    "description": "Sort slot indices by descending gain ratio then ascending index. Each node records the maximum (local count,global prior,-class), local support N and winning hits. Partition recursively by ordered slot values, stop on purity or exhausted slots, and drop a leaf matching its parent's default. Prediction follows matching edges in slot order; on the first missing edge it returns that node default, support fraction and visited path. Leaf-pruning preserves the label at that branch, not its original confidence."
